    feat_cta_sales: "Treat Aiden a Coffee",
    // --- FAQ ---
    faq_q1: "Is eRPH Pro compliant with JPN and PPD requirements?",
    faq_a1: "Yes. Our templates are meticulously designed to follow the TS25 and CUP 2.0 formats recognized by the Ministry of Education. The digital signatures and archival systems meet official standard operating procedures (SOP).",
    faq_q2: "How does the AI Lesson Assistant work?",
    faq_a2: "We integrate directly with Google Gemini 1.5 Pro. You simply provide a topic and grade level, and our engine cross-references the official DSKP to generate structured objectives, success criteria, and activities in seconds.",
    faq_q3: "Where is my data stored?",
    faq_a3: "Your data is stored in high-security cloud clusters with real-time backups. We utilize AES-256 encryption at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit. Your security is our highest priority.",
    faq_q4: "Can the Principal sign RPHs remotely?",
    faq_a4: "Absolutely. eRPH Pro features a mobile-responsive reviewer portal where Principals and GPKs can validate, comment, and sign lesson plans from any device at any time.",
    faq_q5: "What subjects are supported?",
    faq_a5: "We support all subjects listed in the Malaysian DSKP, from Standard 1 (Year 1) to Form 6 (STPM). The AI generation currently supports BM, English, Chinese (SJKC), and Tamil (SJKT).",
    faq_q6: "Is there a subscription fee for schools?",
    faq_a6: "We offer tiered pricing based on the number of teachers. Most schools qualify for our 'Platinum EDU' grant which significantly reduces initial setup costs. Contact our sales team for a custom quote.",
    faq_q7: "How do I sync my DSKP?",
    faq_a7: "The DSKP is automatically synced from our centralized repository. When the Ministry of Education updates any standards, your eRPH Pro portal will reflect these changes within 24 hours.",
    faq_q8: "Can I use eRPH Pro offline?",
    faq_a8: "While a connection is required to sync with the DSKP and AI services, you can save your current session's work locally. Once reconnected, the system will auto-sync your progress to the cloud.",
    faq_q9: "How secure is the digital signature?",
    faq_a9: "Our digital signatures are cryptographically bound to the user's session and identity. Each signature carries a timestamp and a unique audit trail, making it more secure than traditional ink signatures.",
    faq_q10: "What kind of training is provided?",
    faq_a10: "We provide full-day onboarding sessions for teachers and a specialized 'Digital Leadership' workshop for school admins. Our dedicated support team is also available via Telegram and Email.",
    faq_q11: "How do I create my first RPH?",
    faq_a11: "Log in to the portal, navigate to 'My Lesson Plans' and click 'Create Plan'. Use the DSKP Browser to pick your standards and the AI Assistant to generate a draft in seconds.",
